          "snippet": {
            "line": 1137,
            "text": "theorem physical_jet_bound (hcone : FullTrueCone v) (n : ℕ) :\n    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 < C ∧ ∃ N : ℕ, ∀ eta ∈ Icc (-1 : ℝ) 1,\n      ∀ X ∈ Ioo (NominalConeAssembly.activeLeft W) (NominalConeAssembly.activeRight W),\n        ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ n (fun p : ℝ × ℝ => stress v.profiles F.data.h (p.2, p.1)) (eta, X)‖ ≤\n          C * zeta v X / distance v X ^ N"
          }
